\f1\fs22 \'93You may find what I am about to say difficult to believe. Anthony Hardy, Cleaner, L.2 is the sole remaining heir of Jamison Hardy, Corporate Magnate. Not only that, as far as I can tell, he is the only living direct descendant.\'94 \
\'93Oh, come on!\'94 Chanta burst out laughing . \'93You can do better than that.\'94\
 \'93It is a fact, Anthony. Your grandfather, may the market be merciful to his memory, would fuck the hair on a barber shop floor. He had quite a number of children, all outside of wedlock, scattered throughout Ulyssia to various different mothers. When he was declared dead, his relatives and his heirs, were hunted down and murdered. A small group, my father being one, all prodigies of Jamison Hardy were tasked to protect the last few survivors.\'94\
\'93Why would you do that? His fortune must have evaporated by now.\'94 Hayley did not sound impressed.\
